_item_assets/steam/apps/3546040/extras/11.jpg?t=1740541179\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then gradually place the image in the corresponding position:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546040/extras/22.jpg?t=1740541179\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The image gradually becomes complete:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546040/extras/55.jpg?t=1740541179\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come and give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["hgmGame","bird gogogo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546040/header.jpg?t=1740541179","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved. For cooperation, please contact the official website","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099934,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099934/movie480.mp4?t=1740541174","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099934/movie_max.mp4?t=1740541174"},"name":"dog","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099934/f0ad354c30b24483027765d91a77c0c5953799af/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740541174","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099934/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740541174","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099934/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740541174"}}],"name":"hgmGame-dog","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows7/8/9/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-6100U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 200 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2